<div class="graphics-article-title" >
  Hyperlight Down
</div>
<div class="centered-article-text" style="padding-top: 10px;">
  <p>
    New for the FW19 season are the additions of the Hyperlight Down Vest and Jacket. Snug fitting, extremely lightweight and packable make the Hyperlight duo a versatile travel companion for the colder months of winter and valuable layering piece. The quality of the down we sourced for both the jacket and vest is extremely high. Fill power rating stands at 800 and the down to feather cluster ratio is 90/10 so there will be minimal feathers poking through the lightweight exterior of the jacket. 
  </p>
</div>

