<div class="centered-article-text">
  <p style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px; max-width: 500px; margin: 20px auto;">
    We equipped both the Hyperlight styles with a reversible YKK center front chest pocket zipper so they can be packed away into a macaroni box sized bag. Sleeve cuffs feature a snug fitting elastic hem while the waist hem utilizes locking elastic cords that funnel into the interior hand pocket wells. All zippers are finished with silicone dipped, two cord pulls for easy access with gloves on. Reflective heat transfers appear on the neck (Adsum logotype) and on the lower back (800 Fill Power icon).
  </p> 
