<div class="centered-article-text">
 <p style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px; max-width: 500px; margin: 20px auto;">
    All of our down filled styles require a thorough shaking out prior to first use. Take the jacket and shake it as if it were a jug of orange juice then hang it on a coat hanger at room temperature. The down clusters need time to fluff up after being packed tightly for transportation to their new owner.
  </p>
